(7718338, 1269342, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s really beautiful, but there''s a halo behind the tree that really stands out. It looks like you tried to bring out the tree and it ended up having a contrast that was much higher than the contrast in the flowers or the grasses on the other side of the road. A hint of more contrast in the flowers and fixing the tree would make a gorgeous piece of art, imo.</td>', 'It''s really beautiful, but there''s a halo behind the tree that really stands out. It looks like you tried to bring out the tree and it ended up having a contrast that was much higher than the contrast in the flowers or the grasses on the other side of the road. A hint of more contrast in the flowers and fixing the tree would make a gorgeous piece of art, imo.', '2022-04-07 08:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
